  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**BODMAS Table:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nGiven expression : 16 * 4 * 8 * 10 * 2 * 43 \n\nAfter replacing the * by signs, we get:\n\nOption 1) ÷, ×, –, +, = \n\n**__16 ÷ 4__** × 8 – 10 + 2 = 43 \n\n= **__4 __****__× 8__** – 10 + 2 = 43 \n\n= **__32__** - 10 **__+ 2__** = 43\n\n= **__34 __- 10** = 43\n\n= 24 ≠ 43\n\n \n\nGiven expression : 16 * 4 * 8 * 10 * 2 * 43 \n\nAfter replacing the * by signs, we get:\n\nOption 2) ÷, ×, +, –, = \n\n16 * 4 * 8 * 10 * 2 * 43 \n\n= **__16 ÷ 4__** × 8 + 10 – 2 = 43\n\n= **__4 __****__× 8__** + 10 – 2 = 43\n\n= **__32 + 10__** - 2 = 43\n\n= __**42 - 2**__ = 43\n\n= 40 ≠ 43\n\n \n\nGiven expression : 16 * 4 * 8 * 10 * 2 * 43 \n\nAfter replacing the * by signs, we get:\n\nOption 3) ×, ÷, –, +, = \n\n16 * 4 * 8 * 10 * 2 * 43 \n\n= 16 × **__4 ÷ 8__** – 10 + 2 = 43\n\n= **__16 × 0.5__** - 10 + 2 = 43\n\n= **__8__** - 10 __**+ 2**__ = 43\n\n= **__10 - 10__** = 43\n\n= 0 ≠ 43\n\n \n\nGiven expression : 16 * 4 * 8 * 10 * 2 * 43 \n\nAfter replacing the * by signs, we get:\n\nOption 4) +, ×, –, ÷, = \n\n16 * 4 * 8 * 10 * 2 * 43 \n\n= 16 + 4 × 8 – **__10 ÷ 2__** = 43\n\n= 16 + **__4 × 8__** – 5 = 43\n\n= __**16 + 32**__ – 5 = 43\n\n= __**48 - 5**__ = 43\n\n**= 43 = 43**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\"**.",
